{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/9f642932106fe3be931c4ba725c93c35.gif?t=1767725733\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/9f642932106fe3be931c4ba725c93c35.poster.avif?t=1767725733\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/e8ea88c28dfdb98aad1c313d1ec1f6d4.apng?t=1767725733\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/e8ea88c28dfdb98aad1c313d1ec1f6d4.poster.avif?t=1767725733\" class=\"bb_img\" width=544 height=98 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action 2D platformer featuring a zany, cartoonish style. Combine classic run and gun gameplay with close melee attacks to deal heavy blows, knock enemies around and increase your combo score to unleash even more powerful attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/add52d3e7d2b25bdba8f2dc322ff03a3.apng?t=1767725733\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/add52d3e7d2b25bdba8f2dc322ff03a3.poster.avif?t=1767725733\" class=\"bb_img\" width=458 height=76 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our bubbly, goofy protagonist with a can-do attitude. Use her blaster to stun enemies and then set them up for hard hitting melee attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/db7510a1f62137f9b8db5dc6e62f5366.poster.avif?t=1767725733\" width=416 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/db7510a1f62137f9b8db5dc6e62f5366.webm?t=1767725733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/f53c7cd07bb7df6e1dfe69a2f91b3c7b.apng?t=1767725733\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/f53c7cd07bb7df6e1dfe69a2f91b3c7b.poster.avif?t=1767725733\" class=\"bb_img\" width=484 height=86 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paloo faces many foes, but also has many abilities at her disposal. Her stun blaster will open up enemies so that they can combo'd. Use Paloo's signature drill attack, ground pound and other abilities to send enemies flying when they are stunned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/486c1589de8c04e558562594eb5238e6.poster.avif?t=1767725733\" width=416 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/486c1589de8c04e558562594eb5238e6.webm?t=1767725733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/3b5cb2271f0c03c16389eadd223ebb8e.apng?t=1767725733\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/3b5cb2271f0c03c16389eadd223ebb8e.poster.avif?t=1767725733\" class=\"bb_img\" width=710 height=168 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use objects in the environment to your advantage. Knock them into your enemies or use them to increase your combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/6552b1c27e6955022e5030ae5e8740ad.poster.avif?t=1767725733\" width=410 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/6552b1c27e6955022e5030ae5e8740ad.webm?t=1767725733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/1646f6f143c7b6cb594635ed91cd66c1.apng?t=1767725733\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/1646f6f143c7b6cb594635ed91cd66c1.poster.avif?t=1767725733\" class=\"bb_img\" width=522 height=72 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From bats to bandits to multi-legged alien reptiles, each foe has their own way of attacking. Use your different moves and abilities to dodge, shoot, and knock the enemies into each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s